From: Abhinav Gupta <abg@openai.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 22:17:06 +0000
Subject: Add isolated database foundation

Saffron auxiliary state needs schema evolution without touching a
Codex-owned database or migration ledger.

Introduce `saffron_1.sqlite`, its private SQLx migrator, and an empty
migration directory. The foundation creates no application tables.

